        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***EXCELLENT LOCATION / WALK- IN CONDITION / 3 BED 3 BATH / RED BRICK FACADE / GFCH/ DOUBLE GLAZING/ FRONT & REAR NOT OVERLOOKED***\r\n\r\nKelly Bradshaw are delighted to present to the market 15 The Green , Beaumont Woods. Set in a quiet cul de sac location, 15 The Green oozes curb appeal with its beautiful red brick façade. This family home has been well-maintained by its current owners and is in walk-in condition.\r\n\r\nDownstairs the spacious accommodation comprises a bright hallway with guest wc, generous  living room with feature fireplace,  double doors open wide to the dining room and a large kitchen with pine wall & floor units. \r\n\r\nUpstairs  3 well-proportioned bedrooms including primary with ensuite and ample storage and family bathroom complete the accommodation.  Both bathrooms have high techIXLTactics, light, heat and steam extraction system.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of this gorgeous family home is a  charming, sun-drenched garden which offers a peaceful and private retreat, perfect for relaxing or outdoor entertaining. The space features a beautifully paved patio area that seamlessly flows into a well-maintained lawn, providing a versatile footprint for garden furniture and potted plants.\r\n\r\nEnclosed by attractive, warm-toned wooden fencing, the garden benefits from a natural screen of mature trees and established ivy, ensuring a sense of seclusion. A practical wooden shed provides convenient storage, while the bright, open aspect invites plenty of natural light, creating an inviting atmosphere throughout the day. It is a wonderful, low-maintenance outdoor space that perfectly complements a relaxed lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe location of this property is second to none with a host of amenities in the vicinity. Convenient to Beaumont Hospital, Dublin City University & Dublin Airport there is also a good selection of schools, shops & sports facilities close by. Beaumont Woods is well-served by public transport and also benefits from only a short commute to M50/M1 motorways.\r\n\r\nEarly Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
